#: ../../whatsnew/2.5.rst:662
msgid "The code in *BLOCK* is executed."
msgstr "*BLOCK* 内のコードが実行されます。"

#: ../../whatsnew/2.5.rst:664
msgid ""
"If *BLOCK* raises an exception, the ``__exit__(type, value, traceback)`` is "
