"    cursor.execute('insert into ...')\n"
"    cursor.execute('delete from ...')\n"
"    # ... more operations ..."
msgstr ""

#: ../../whatsnew/2.5.rst:693
msgid ""
"The transaction should be committed if the code in the block runs flawlessly "
