"りません。そのようなことをするとプログラムが SQL インジェクション攻撃に対し脆"
"弱になりかねません。"

#: ../../whatsnew/2.5.rst:1987
msgid ""
"Instead, use the DB-API's parameter substitution.  Put ``?`` as a "
"placeholder wherever you want to use a value, and then provide a tuple of "
"values as the second argument to the cursor's :meth:`~sqlite3.Cursor."
"execute` method.  (Other database modules may use a different placeholder, "
"such as ``%s`` or ``:1``.) For example::"
msgstr ""

